Sawf89eFGAThZ9bcwRV95233QztSM_4G9y91A&oe=6AC24DE5"}, {"file_name": "ss2.png", "id": "788271410826590", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618442_788271414159923_2750812522125241492_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CCE9levqOO0Q7kNvwE6lUl7&_nc_oc=AdqSbhW6ldwsX2B84CU56KmkSCe72QmoNYhUA5SAanh-goBh1EOS3H36glIRD-NfsFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPhVLqzVKFa_R9_FGLi5Kf_WpTuXWyqZI8JGfhnTHw0_g&oe=6AC26531"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "1834336527161494", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1834336530494827_5000098833448038100_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lfPB60ISzhgQ7kNvwFkq1mF&_nc_oc=AdqKEwr7iW53V88ztmX8EnTRwZq6B860OVQ_IOnyrHrLKG-9UNV2nwCWW9NbvBOXKmU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP5nuk6AM3sqva-QhUfKHB9lZiVDuC_74fpMguu_-4aRw&oe=6AC274E3"}, {"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 30.png", "id": "817942420570190", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618093_817942423903523_2579781587199864330_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=17rqkVj2K0kQ7kNvwFmCiOj&_nc_oc=AdrNeN_1FZM3AWngay7nlW8M_BRbb5vvdyUZziFo3hevsmzbi41x-S9M9zQmj3uWFuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPvoeKqiJvrMtixfEXQuNhHZn9rHcbRB8UemMoYgZcKnw&oe=6AC2584A"}, {"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 3.png", "id": "1476300653694267", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_1476300657027600_2840025129162091773_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZE5uCrAD_kAQ7kNvwGcwlIm&_nc_oc=AdpjdUH8xw_TDlZigKxqfufRKLX8HI4wuh_FrcpdI8OZ94YxXoDO7V5NHuyW9j0c7t0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPotadVFy8sBCb-OEyZ5KFqJi8yIOP7hYzC4Abm8H4eHw&oe=6AC273DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "QuixPlayer", "keywords": ["360VideoPlayer", "180VideoPlayer"], "long_description": "**QuixPlayer - Control 180deg / 360deg Video Playback with QR Codes**\n\nQuixPlayer is a VR video player for Meta Quest 3 and 3S that enables simple, reliable, and fully offline synchronized video playback.\n\nUsing only a QR code, you can start video playback across multiple headsets at the same timing. No internet or local network is required, making it ideal for environments with restricted connectivity.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n**Offline Playback Control**\nScan a QR code to start video playback at a specified timing or condition. QuixPlayer operates entirely offline for stable performance.\n\n**Simple Operation**\nNo complex controller input is needed. Just scan a QR code and the experience begins.\n\n**Playback Modes**\nSYNC: Periodic time sync based on the headset clock (e.g. TRG:SYNC:5).\nREL: Relative countdown after scanning (e.g. TRG:REL:10).\nABS: Absolute time playback (e.g. TRG:ABS:110000).\n\n**QR Code Options**\nQR codes can specify video file name, video type (180deg or 360deg), and layout mode (None, SideBySide, OverUnder, SideBySide3D, OverUnder3D).\n\n**Flexible QR Code Format**\nTRG:{MODE}:{VALUE}?name={file_name}&type={360 or 180}&layout={layout}\n\n## License\nThe Store price covers personal, non-commercial use only. Any organizational or commercial use\u2014including events, training, facility operations, or customer experiences\u2014requires a commercial license. Contact NeoRealX before purchase for pricing by use, devices, and duration.\n*Applies to purchases on or after Aug 28, 2026.\n", "short_description": "Easily sync and play 180\u00b0/360\u00b0 videos on Meta Quest by simply scanning a QR code."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://neorealx.com/QuixPlayer-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NeoRealX", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://neorealx.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "con